   "len": 76,
   "first": 4529,
   "line": "You grab the scarf and it grabs back.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S62",
   "size": "",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 4605,
   "line": "It does not push you. It carries you.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S63",
   "size": "",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 4681,
   "line": "Somewhere, a flag is still flying away.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S64",
   "size": "",
   "key": 71,
   "len": 114,
   "first": 4774,
   "line": "Hold your helmet. Something enormous is coming.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S65",
   "size": "",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 90,
   "first": 4888,
   "line": "That enormous thing is the Great Red Spot.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S66",
   "size": "",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 81,
   "first": 4978,
   "line": "It is a storm twice as wide as Earth.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S67",
   "size": "",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 88,
   "first": 5059,
   "line": "People have watched it for more than three hundred years.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S68",
   "size": "",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 5147,
   "line": "Juno's gravity data says it reaches",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S69",
   "size": "",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 5215,
   "line": "about five hundred kilometres deep.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S70",
   "size": "",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 5284,
   "line": "So this is no surface swirl.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S71",
   "size": "",
   "key": 41,
   "len": 66,
   "first": 5359,
   "line": "It is a storm with a basement.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S72",
   "size": "",
   "key": 29,
   "len": 46,
   "first": 5425,
   "line": "You spiral around its edge",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S73",
   "size": "",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 5471,
   "line": "like a coin in a funnel.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S74",
   "size": "",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 61,
   "first": 5523,
   "line": "Here is Earth, for scale.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S75",
   "size": "",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 5584,
   "line": "Two of them would fit across the storm.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S76",
   "size": "",
   "key": 29,
   "len": 46,
   "first": 5649,
   "line": "You wave at Earth.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S77",
   "size": "",
   "key": 33,
   "len": 54,
   "first": 5695,
   "line": "It does not wave back.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S78",
   "size": "",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 51,
   "first": 5749,
   "line": "Three hundred years of weather.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S79",
   "size": "",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 64,
   "first": 5800,
   "line": "You are only visiting for one afternoon.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S80",
   "size": "",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 5864,
   "line": "Time to peel away and drop lower.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S81",
   "size": "",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 82,
   "first": 5940,
   "line": "You peel away from the storm and keep dropping.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S82",
   "size": "",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 77,
   "first": 6022,
   "line": "The light turns amber and dim.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S83",
   "size": "",
   "key": 67,
   "len": 108,
   "first": 6099,
   "line": "Layer two: ammonium hydrosulfide crystals.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S84",
   "size": "",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 6207,
   "line": "Try saying that with a helmet on.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S85",
   "size": "",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 57,
   "first": 6263,
   "line": "Your gauge swaps its label.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S86",
   "size": "",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 70,
   "first": 6320,
   "line": "The crystals tinkle against your visor.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S87",
   "size": "",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 6390,
   "line": "Down again, and the world goes blue-grey.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S88",
   "size": "",
   "key": 61,
   "len": 98,
   "first": 6475,
   "line": "Layer three: water ice and water vapour.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S89",
   "size": "",
   "key": 61,
   "len": 99,
   "first": 6573,
   "line": "Real water! Finally, something familiar.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S90",
   "size": "",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 70,
   "first": 6672,
   "line": "It is the same stuff as your water bottle.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S91",
   "size": "",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 6742,
   "line": "That is the third and last cloud layer.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S92",
   "size": "",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 6814,
   "line": "About seventy-one kilometres, and the clouds are done.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S93",
   "size": "",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 96,
   "first": 6907,
   "line": "You expected a floor. There is none.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S94",
   "size": "",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 67,
   "first": 7003,
   "line": "It gets darker, and it gets heavier.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S95",
   "size": "",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 7070,
   "line": "Your gauge has stopped showing numbers.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S96",
   "size": "",
   "key": 44,
   "len": 71,
   "first": 7138,
   "line": "Its needle just shakes and looks away.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S97",
   "size": "",
   "key": 33,
   "len": 54,
   "first": 7209,
   "line": "Your suit starts to creak.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S98",
   "size": "",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 91,
   "first": 7263,
   "line": "NASA says the pressures and temperatures deep inside Jupiter",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S99",
   "size": "",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 7354,
   "line": "crush, melt and vaporize spacecraft.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S100",
   "size": "",
   "key": 57,
   "len": 92,
   "first": 7447,
   "line": "So you bring a toy probe, to test the theory.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S101",
   "size": "",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 82,
   "first": 7539,
   "line": "First, it squishes flat like a pancake.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S102",
   "size": "",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 7621,
   "line": "Then it melts into a puddle.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S103",
   "size": "",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 91,
   "first": 7684,
   "line": "Then it vanishes, and your suit creaks louder.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S104",
   "size": "",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 7775,
   "line": "Your suit would like a word with management.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S105",
   "size": "",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 74,
   "first": 7853,
   "line": "You pat the helmet. Brave thoughts.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S106",
   "size": "",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 94,
   "first": 7927,
   "line": "Then the cloud around you simply ends.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S107",
   "size": "",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 94,
   "first": 8021,
   "line": "Below the clouds, the sky becomes an ocean.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S108",
   "size": "",
   "key": 68,
   "len": 109,
   "first": 8115,
   "line": "Hydrogen, squeezed until it flows like a liquid.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S109",
   "size": "",
   "key": 64,
   "len": 103,
   "first": 8224,
   "line": "NASA says it is the largest ocean in the solar system,",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S110",
   "size": "",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 8327,
   "line": "and it is made of hydrogen, not water.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S111",
   "size": "",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 61,
   "first": 8412,
   "line": "You slip in without a splash.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S112",
   "size": "",
   "key": 62,
   "len": 100,
   "first": 8473,
   "line": "No beach. No boat. No shore at all.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S113",
   "size": "",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 88,
   "first": 8573,
   "line": "You try a breaststroke, because why not.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S114",
   "size": "",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 57,
   "first": 8661,
   "line": "The ocean does not care.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S115",
   "size": "",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 77,
   "first": 8718,
   "line": "Up and down stop meaning anything.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S116",
   "size": "",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 8795,
   "line": "You float past glowing bubbles of light.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S117",
   "size": "",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 8870,
   "line": "You wave at a bubble. It is polite.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S118",
   "size": "",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 80,
   "first": 8955,
   "line": "Somewhere far above, there used to be sky.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S119",
   "size": "",
   "key": 36,
   "len": 58,
   "first": 9035,
   "line": "And deeper still, the ocean",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S120",
   "size": "",
   "key": 44,
   "len": 71,
   "first": 9093,
   "line": "starts to shine like metal.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S121",
   "size": "",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 9164,
   "line": "Perhaps halfway to the centre,",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S122",
   "size": "",
   "key": 37,
   "len": 59,
   "first": 9216,
   "line": "the hydrogen changes again.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S123",
   "size": "",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 9275,
   "line": "NASA says it starts to conduct",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S124",
   "size": "",
   "key": 31,
   "len": 50,
   "first": 9327,
   "line": "electricity like a metal.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S125",
   "size": "",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 70,
   "first": 9377,
   "line": "Metallic hydrogen. Silver,",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S126",
   "size": "",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 62,
   "first": 9447,
   "line": "heavy, and a little smug.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S127",
   "size": "",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 73,
   "first": 9509,
   "line": "Now add the spin from before.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S128",
   "size": "",
   "key": 68,
   "len": 110,
   "first": 9582,
   "line": "A spinning ball of conducting liquid acts like a dynamo,",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S129",
   "size": "",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 77,
   "first": 9692,
   "line": "and a dynamo makes a magnetic field.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S130",
   "size": "",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 9769,
   "line": "Jupiter's is sixteen to fifty-four",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S131",
   "size": "",
   "key": 31,
   "len": 50,
   "first": 9838,
   "line": "times as powerful as Earth's.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S132",
   "size": "",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 62,
   "first": 9888,
   "line": "Sparks crackle off your gloves.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S133",
   "size": "",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 94,
   "first": 9950,
   "line": "Your compass needle spins like a roulette wheel.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S134",
   "size": "",
   "key": 69,
   "len": 111,
   "first": 10044,
   "line": "Far above, the polar sky glows with aurora.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S135",
   "size": "",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 82,
   "first": 10155,
   "line": "Everything around you is shiny, except you.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S136",
   "size": "",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 77,
   "first": 10237,
   "line": "The compass gives up and just points at you.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S137",
   "size": "",
   "key": 71,
   "len": 114,
   "first": 10314,
   "line": "Almost there, surely. Surely there is a floor.",
   "note": "ch9"
  },
  {
   "id": "S138",
   "size": "",
   "key": 57,
   "len": 92,
   "first": 10428,
   "line": "Surely, at the bottom, there is a floor.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S139",
   "size": "",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 83,
   "first": 10520,
   "line": "NASA says Juno found something odd.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S140",
   "size": "",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 94,
   "first": 10603,
   "line": "Juno is the spacecraft that measured it, from orbit.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S141",
   "size": "",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 91,
   "first": 10697,
   "line": "The core is fuzzy, and partly dissolved.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S142",
   "size": "",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 51,
   "first": 10788,
   "line": "It is not a solid floor.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S143",
   "size": "",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 10839,
   "line": "You reach out a boot to stand on it.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S144",
   "size": "",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 61,
   "first": 10907,
   "line": "The floor fades as you touch it.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S145",
   "size": "",
   "key": 44,
   "len": 71,
   "first": 10968,
   "line": "You try again. It fades again.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S146",
   "size": "",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 11039,
   "line": "Your gauge shows depth,",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S147",
   "size": "",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 96,
   "first": 11087,
   "line": "and under that, ground: still none.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S148",
   "size": "",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 11183,
   "line": "So you are not falling onto the bottom.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S149",
   "size": "",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 11251,
   "line": "You are just sinking into a soft glow.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S150",
   "size": "",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 11327,
   "line": "It is quiet and bright,",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S151",
   "size": "",
   "key": 34,
   "len": 55,
   "first": 11375,
   "line": "and extremely not a floor.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S152",
   "size": "",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 86,
   "first": 11430,
   "line": "Which means it is time to wake up.",
   "note": "ch10"
  },
  {
   "id": "S153",
   "size": "",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 11516,
   "line": "And now, back to reality.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S154",
   "size": "",
   "key": 29,
   "len": 47,
   "first": 11579,
   "line": "You are on a rooftop,",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S155",
   "size": "",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 74,
   "first": 11626,
   "line": "wide awake, before sunrise.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S156",
   "size": "",
   "key": 41,
   "len": 66,
   "first": 11700,
   "line": "You can see Jupiter yourself.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S157",
   "size": "",
   "key": 31,
   "len": 50,
   "first": 11766,
   "line": "On the mornings of the fifteenth",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S158",
   "size": "",
   "key": 33,
   "len": 54,
   "first": 11816,
   "line": "and sixteenth of November,",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S159",
   "size": "",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 11870,
   "line": "look southeast before sunrise, says NASA.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S160",
   "size": "",
   "key": 64,
   "len": 103,
   "first": 11955,
   "line": "Jupiter and Mars will sit one point two degrees apart.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S161",
   "size": "",
   "key": 74,
   "len": 119,
   "first": 12058,
   "line": "That is a little more than two full Moons side by side.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S162",
   "size": "",
   "key": 36,
   "len": 58,
   "first": 12177,
   "line": "Jupiter is the brighter point.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S163",
   "size": "",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 12235,
   "line": "Mars is the other one.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S164",
   "size": "",
   "key": 29,
   "len": 46,
   "first": 12283,
   "line": "Do not mix them up.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S165",
   "size": "",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 96,
   "first": 12329,
   "line": "No spacesuit needed, and no falling required.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S166",
   "size": "",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 62,
   "first": 12425,
   "line": "Set an alarm for the fifteenth.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S167",
   "size": "",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 107,
   "first": 12487,
   "line": "If you could fall into one planet, which would you pick?",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S168",
   "size": "",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 74,
   "first": 12594,
   "line": "Tomorrow: a new what if.",
   "note": "ch11"
  },
  {
   "id": "S169",
   "size": "",
